288
00:19:41,760 --> 00:19:43,160
Not a chance!

289
00:19:43,160 --> 00:19:45,800
You have a lot of resolve for a mouse.

290
00:19:46,720 --> 00:19:48,300
And that's what will kill you.

291
00:19:48,300 --> 00:19:51,920
Now, be gone, Mythical Beats Magic!

292
00:19:52,260 --> 00:19:53,140
Move away!

293
00:19:56,140 --> 00:19:57,260
Speed dragons!

294
00:19:59,040 --> 00:20:01,060
Less filtering down my power!

295
00:20:01,060 --> 00:20:21,120
We'll be right back!

296
00:20:23,180 --> 00:20:25,380
We'll be right back!

297
00:20:25,380 --> 00:20:26,380
We'll see you later!

298
