300
00:20:48,380 --> 00:20:53,380
Not yet. It's not... It's not over!

301
00:20:53,380 --> 00:20:58,380
You haven't won! We haven't given up and we're not going to!

302
00:20:58,380 --> 00:21:02,380
You're right. It isn't over yet.

303
00:21:02,380 --> 00:21:06,380
The real despair starts now!

304
00:21:23,380 --> 00:21:37,380
You're here for one. For hours, lately. I've been crying for hours, baby. I wish you were here.

305
00:21:37,380 --> 00:21:48,380
You gave me all those letters. The pain is gone.

306
00:21:48,380 --> 00:21:50,380
One is the one!

307
00:21:50,380 --> 00:21:51,380
One is the one!

308
00:21:51,380 --> 00:21:53,380
Because we're perfect!

309
00:21:53,380 --> 00:22:10,380
Focus it!

310
00:22:10,380 --> 00:22:15,380
You know you're not alone

311
00:22:15,380 --> 00:22:18,380
Cause we are perfect as for

312
00:22:18,380 --> 00:22:21,380
離れ離れても

313
00:22:21,380 --> 00:22:24,380
繋がるように

314
00:22:24,380 --> 00:22:28,380
いつも somebody

315
00:22:28,380 --> 00:22:31,380
私がいるから

316
00:22:31,380 --> 00:22:33,380
Close out of me

317
00:22:33,380 --> 00:22:35,380
And I'll go over for you

