00:22:40,380 --> 00:22:45,380
プライズ

320
00:22:45,380 --> 00:22:50,380
プライブス

321
00:22:50,380 --> 00:22:53,380
What did you say that mythical beast magic spell was called?

322
00:22:53,380 --> 00:22:55,380
Do you really want to know, Bug?

323
00:22:55,380 --> 00:22:56,380
Find me...

324
00:22:56,380 --> 00:22:57,380
Who are you calling Bug?

325
00:22:57,380 --> 00:22:59,380
I'm royalty, thank you!

326
00:22:59,380 --> 00:23:01,380
This is the spell.

327
00:23:01,380 --> 00:23:03,380
Well, go ahead... read it!

328
00:23:03,380 --> 00:23:04,380
I can't.

329
00:23:04,380 --> 00:23:05,380
It's easy!

330
00:23:05,380 --> 00:23:07,380
Evil of Webby.

331
00:23:07,380 --> 00:23:08,380
Come on!

332
00:23:08,380 --> 00:23:09,380
Evil of Webby.

333
00:23:09,380 --> 00:23:12,020
Piggy Peggy Piper picked a peck of pickled persimmons.

334
00:23:12,080 --> 00:23:14,220
Not even close. Listen to me one more time.

335
00:23:15,640 --> 00:23:19,020
Whales and dolphins may look like big fish, but they're actually mammals.

336
00:23:19,260 --> 00:23:22,520
Bigness is the only difference between udon, salmon, and hiyamugi.

337
00:23:22,700 --> 00:23:25,200
