342
00:23:39,380 --> 00:23:42,660
I shall crush each and every one of you with my own hand.

343
00:23:43,160 --> 00:23:46,260
Black Clover, page 47. The only weapon.

344
00:23:46,840 --> 00:23:49,040
My magic is devouring despair.

